  "citation": "Post W M; Mann L K (1990): Changes in Soil Organic Carbon and Nitrogen as a Result of Cultivation. Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/TCM.006",
